{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04094","headline":"饯泽州卢使君赴任 · 苏頲","name":"饯泽州卢使君赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道降纶书，爲邦建彩旟。\n政凭循吏往，才以贵卿除。\n词赋良无敌，声华蔼有余。\n荣承四岳後，请绝五天初。\n关路通秦壁，城池接晋墟。\n撰期行子赋，分典列侯居。\n别望喧追饯，离言系惨舒。\n平芜寒蛬乱，乔木夜蝉疎。\n寥泬秋先起，推移月向诸。\n旧交何以赠，客至待烹鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}